<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-31T00:55:30.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:55:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Army drones have struck displaced persons camps in South Wollo and Amhara, killing civilians including children, while armed clashes between Oromo and Somali groups in Moyale have forced thousands to flee into Kenya. Gunfire is being heard near the Ethiopian-Kenya border as civilians continue to evacuate, and Ethiopia and Eritrea have now severed diplomatic ties, raising regional tension. Russian Su-35 fighter jets and S-400 air defence systems have been deployed in Ethiopia as fighting spreads across Tigray, Amhara and Oromia. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxObWxFck1EbEF1MjVtOFo5RFpsbHh0TFJDa251X2pPeEtISEI4UDVRZzR2ME5qS2NyRWw2Zi0wVWlUTkFIRVZ0d3JoanhFc3MzdlMtWlJaRTh1amh6cng0S0lDOFlvY2VUWDNabFpQaUl4clVLY0pHUXM0bzJZRzhJSzB3RmhiTE81eURZQUEzQzRKRzhSUjV4UFBVcmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQdjg3cHBjbWNMaW12d1VveTI0Nk8wQ2I3UDdNU09WVVVUb1IzWlJRa3F5YzNaLVhBZ1FJTWJHSjdmWVh1TWxkUVBvYUhwWTMwMDhsaUhQYmRoYVc3dEUwRUxPYXp2TzB2a2tMdC0tNjRUZExZZ2lWRFlkcmNiN1NKdXdwV3VGUXkzUHhIUWhCcnBKd2hHNnE2RTRoRGtZLXBLcmhRdlh0amszY3VXTFBUQ1ROWjNGRnQ4cmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Organization for World Peace&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE8yc1pDR2doTXVtWU5XZ2hfNDJhU1VjSUtlanB3Q3I3LUc1aEl5N1ZtMDNuQ2xiekFCcDZwaWRnSGc1RXJiQ3l2SU5VNjcydFNxM2VFU004REdVYTRUakJDTlpqNVlXazRtazNmMjB2V3lYemc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brooklyn Eagle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQenlzQTZfNHQ2OW13RjlJRTFaSmR5bXoybnRqOFh5bUlXS0hLUW9FMjNjYkpjQWs3Z0dLRThDMTNVcHRMSHA5cnNEOE1nRGptMUhFbEFVX2lYWVFYVmM4VG1jbWhESFowaGNPaEx4RjBtaUpuWWZMQkt1ZjJqTEh5